{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 110,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "The LORD says to my Lord, “Sit at my right hand, until I make your enemies your footstool for your feet.”",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华对我主说：",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華對我主說：",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "The LORD will send out the rod of your strength out of Zion. Rule among your enemies.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华必使你从伸出能力的杖来；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華必使你從伸出能力的杖來；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "Your people offer themselves willingly in the day of your power, in holy array. of the womb of the morning, you have the dew of your youth.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "当你掌权的日子， ， 。",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "- 110:3 或译：行军的日子"
          },
          {
            "id": "f2",
            "text": "- 110:3 或译：以圣洁为妆饰"
          },
          {
            "id": "f3",
            "text": "- 110:3 或译：你少年时光耀如清晨的甘露"
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "當你掌權的日子， ， 。",
        "footnotes": [
          {
            "id": "f1",
            "text": "- 110:3 或譯：行軍的日子"
          },
          {
            "id": "f2",
            "text": "- 110:3 或譯：以聖潔為妝飾"
          },
          {
            "id": "f3",
            "text": "- 110:3 或譯：你少年時光耀如清晨的甘露"
          }
        ],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "The LORD has sworn, and will not change his mind: You are a priest forever in the order of Melchizedek.”",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华起了誓，决不后悔，： 的等次永远为祭司。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華起了誓，決不後悔，： 的等次永遠為祭司。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "The Lord is at your right hand. He will crush kings in the day of his wrath.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "在你右边的主，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "在你右邊的主，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "He will judge among the nations. He will heap up dead bodies. He will crush the ruler of the whole earth.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他要在列邦中刑罚， ； 头。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他要在列邦中刑罰， ； 頭。",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "He will drink of the brook on the way; therefore he will lift up his head.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "他要喝路旁的河水，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "他要喝路旁的河水，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}